  ObjectName: Uranus
  ObjectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85ad7f72ff419e847b3f2b2e181ab1fa, type: 3}
  Facts:
  - text: "Uranus is blue-green \u2014 Its pretty color comes from methane gas in
      its atmosphere, which absorbs red light and reflects blue!"
  - text: "It rolls like a ball \u2014 Uranus spins on its side, unlike any other
      planet! It's tilted so much it looks like it's rolling around the Sun"
  - text: "It\u2019s an ice giant \u2014 Uranus is made mostly of icy materials like
      water, methane, and ammonia, not just gas like Jupiter or Saturn."
  - text: "It has rings too! \u2014 Uranus has faint rings that are hard to see,
      but they\u2019re real and circle the planet."
  - text: "It\u2019s one of the coldest planets \u2014 Even though Neptune is farther
      from the Sun, Uranus gets colder, with temperatures dropping to \u2013224\xB0C
      (\u2013371\xB0F)!"
  SceneName: UranusScene
